00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:42,222
Como foi?

225
00:18:45,325 --> 00:18:47,126
Estamos prestes a descobrir.

226
00:18:47,227 --> 00:18:49,196
Tudo bem!

227
00:18:49,296 --> 00:18:50,697
Estamos prontos?

228
